Neil Lennon: “Odsonne Edouard ‘one of best strikers I’ve ever worked with says Celtic’s Neil Lennon”
Fatboab of KDS:
Very impressive performance  going forward. Frimpong was superb first half, Forrest took over in the second. Taylor had two excellent assists. Eddy clearly out of form in Pre Season ( copyright hunners on here) turns up when the real stuff stars and is unplayable. Christie and Moi drifted in and out effectively. Domestically we will destroy teams , but hoping the new keeper sorts out the hesitancy at the back. Can’t go giving the Hun half a dozen corners and not getting hurt.
All in all a very pleasing opener.
@AgentScotland on Twitter
Very good win for Celtic with a few good performances, McGregor the orchastrator, Taylor was very good as was Christie, Edouard was as deadly as ever and still has gears to go, Forrest with an obligatory assist, defence could do a lot better dealing with crosses into the box.
