For all the good stuff we’ve seen going forward, it’s obvious the defence isn’t as ready. Partly down to Hamilton’s approach, but too many easy chances given up and a lot of scrappy challenges falling the wrong way. Understandable after the lay off, plenty to be encouraged about.
